          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Bloody Mayhem"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Twisted Jack Strides three times. Once per Stride, he can attempt a war razor Strike against a creature in his reach at any point during the Stride; he must make each Strike against a different creature, but he doesn't apply his multiple attack penalty until after making all his Strikes. If any of the Strikes are a critical failure, Bloody Mayhem immediately ends."
            },
